{"title":"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find, as a function of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d355fce2af566ceb80d3d58aa61382c5d0bb4c81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, n, \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" /> the sum of the digits of \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/395f3a29a3769af826b23ad1d2ca73fe825dd3d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9 \\times 99 \\times 9999 \\times \\cdots \\times \\left( 10^{2^n} - 1 \\right),\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"22\" /> \nwhere each factor has twice as many digits as the previous one. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d4a02bf7631e569cf2452dff8341b5dceb8b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 2^n$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Let us denote the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/03195d97b2364f20560004a59d0903befd3fba44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\prod_{k=0}^n \\bigl( 10^{2^k}-1 \\bigr)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"102\" height=\"48\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c51a4acedda645113145d008dbfb50d35f1da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />.  We wish to find the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c51a4acedda645113145d008dbfb50d35f1da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>We first note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3e9e84bdcf195f8c81e0bd3d062574dd20cdb37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P_{n-1} &lt; \\prod_{k=0}^{n-1} 10^{2^k} = 10^{2^n-1},\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"50\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13eff1eeaf3a1843e9095c4cc89562ae3e78e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"15\" /> is a number of at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c36f0b157e8c2fbe0638c2f2b378e08d07695aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^n$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> digits.  We also note that the units digit is not equal to zero.  We may thus represent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13eff1eeaf3a1843e9095c4cc89562ae3e78e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"15\" /> as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782da8e4923a29fa96c53eea46ce35e82e763dc2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=0}^{2^n-1} 10^k d_k ,\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"51\" />\nwhere the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d09bd8dc83be3b4a1bc205b9cc6fa40b23c7a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> are digits and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/500bc24c0aa8abda61a852c0483c1645302d7273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_0 \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" />.  Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/6484d06306992a1a7e19fc1ab3d92e9f68997152.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} P_n &amp;= \\bigl( 10^{2^n}-1 \\bigr) P_{n-1} = \\sum_{k=0}^{2^n-1} - 10^k d_k + \\sum_{k=0}^{2^n-1} 10^{2^n+k} d_k \\\\ &amp;= (10-d_0) + \\sum_{k=1}^{2^n-1} 10^k(9-d_k) + 10^{2^n}(d_0-1) + \\sum_{k=1}^{2^n-1} 10^{2^n+k} d_k . \\end{align*}\" width=\"510\" height=\"113\" />\nThus the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54c51a4acedda645113145d008dbfb50d35f1da3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> are\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/2/062efb7a121862a1368e5b0075bf3a94bc51107b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10-d_0, 9-d_1, 9-d_2, \\dotsc, 9-d_{2^n-1}, d_0-1, d_1, d_2, \\dotsc, d_{2^n-1} ,\\]\" width=\"475\" height=\"16\" />\nand the sum of these is evidently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d4a02bf7631e569cf2452dff8341b5dceb8b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 2^n$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />, as desired.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO\" title=\"1992 USAMO\">1992 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?p=356412#356412\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1566/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 51/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3479/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.591      1 -total\n 38.29%    6.353      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 31.47%    5.221      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 28.65%    4.753      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6318:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183503 and revision id 85440. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}